{"version":1,"content":"<p>參加《女神配對計劃2》堅稱單身的俞可程，近日捲入緋聞風波，被指與一名已離婚的無綫（TVB）導演秘密拍拖。</p><p>傳聞指事件觸怒無綫高層，導致她不僅被踢出前晚（19日）台慶的演出名單，最終更缺席盛事。</p><p>由於俞可程在戀愛真人騷《女神2》中一直以單身形象示</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T01:23:51.183043+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T01:01:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T01:17:12.330739+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T01:17:12.330739+00:00","content_hash":"d783b881b0be78f5d43db11459ff39ed561ce47b3e1c5d2badfeaaac2fb4b8c5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}